# Cloud Chess licensing

Cloud Chess uses package-level licenses. This document is the current licensing declaration; each package receives its complete license text when it is created.

| Future package | License |
| --- | --- |
| `packages/chess-core` | MIT |
| `packages/chess-rules-pchess` | MIT |
| `apps/nextcloud` | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (`AGPL-3.0-or-later`) |

Third-party software keeps its own license. In particular, distributed Stockfish builds are GPLv3 and must ship with their required notices and corresponding-source information.

The full canonical license texts are available from the [Open Source Initiative](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT) and [GNU](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html). Before the first public release, this declaration is replaced or supplemented by complete license files in the respective package directories.
